Package: frpp
Title: Flexible Residual Point Processes
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Kyungsub", "Lee", email = "kyungsub@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A local prototype separating an exponential kernel specification
    from its residual distribution. Reuses the public emhawkes interface and
    compares a compatibility bridge with separately assembled residual likelihoods.
    Provides maximum likelihood fitting, fitted-model reconstruction and
    optimizer and covariance diagnostics.
License: GPL (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports: emhawkes (>= 1.0.0), methods, stats
Suggests: knitr, rmarkdown, maxLik
VignetteBuilder: knitr
URL: https://ksublee.github.io/frpp/, https://github.com/ksublee/frpp
BugReports: https://github.com/ksublee/frpp/issues
Collate:
    'spec.R'
    'state-likelihood.R'
    'simulation.R'
    'operations.R'
    'optimizer.R'
    'fit-independent.R'
    'fit.R'
